{"detail": {"templateUuid": "353e30efb2a04185887cba75eea04782", "projectUuid": "c8a49d10fd084648b5801e39bfb1c813", "name": "佐佐木的坦白局！【躲在超市后门吞云吐雾的二人】", "description": "超市的前泽主任意外撞见佐佐木与一位年轻女性同行，且他的手指上戴着一枚容易让人误解的“结婚指环”，随后前泽在聚餐时将这一发现当成八卦告诉了大家。这个消息让内心对佐佐木抱有微妙好感的山田（田山）备受打击，她不仅当场石化，在后续的相处中也变得极度别扭和失落，甚至默默与他保持距离并提起“既然您已经有奥さん（妻子）了……”。然而事实很快水落石出，原来当天与佐佐木在超市同行的女性其实是他的亲妹妹，而那枚所谓的“结婚戒指”也只是妹妹开玩笑强行套在他手上、一时摘不下来才产生的误会。随着真相大白，得知佐佐木依然独身且最想一起抽烟的人是自己后，田山重新找回了往日的活力，两人在后门喫烟所的默契关系也顺利回归正轨。", "coverUrl": "/assets/9daaa19854efc196.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a/a1761d5f947bc08a2eb5cb56cc22edfb15d6217a.mp4", "snapshotId": 26124, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3462983, "ownerUuid": "d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a", "avatar": "/assets/60489f75b1a0bf42.webp", "nickname": "大大大大大", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 61, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3042, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-故事短片", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3042", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1304, "code": "classic_derivative", "tagLabel": "经典衍生", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1304/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6a427540000000001102d9f9?xsec_token=ABylmCXAYMgU0Wwy-NRXKFRCWn3WwE4EF1u_IL_UYu6S0=&xsec_source=pc_user", "createAt": "2026年06月29